        <p class="conclusion">The custom website vs template debate is not about prestige. It is about results. Templates are fine for testing ideas and temporary needs. But if your website is a core part of your growth strategy, custom is the only choice that makes financial sense. The higher upfront cost is an investment, not an expense. And like any good investment, it pays for itself many times over.</p>

